SUMMARY:Spring Shred Day
DESCRIPTION:Spring Shred Day is Almost Here! \nOur Spring Shred Day is happening Saturday\, May 2nd\, and we’re getting excited! 🎉 \nThanks to your support\, we’re able to offer our community a safe\, secure\, and environmentally friendly way to dispose of sensitive documents. We’re truly grateful for your partnership and your commitment to helping us serve our neighbors. 💙 \nThe event is just a few weeks away! Start gathering those old documents and join us for a great day of protecting your information and supporting the community. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
